graph LR
    subgraph Dashboard Flow
        A[User opens Dashboard] --> B[KPIs load<br>correct card/set counts]
        B --> C[Movers section loads<br>30d default period]
        C --> D{Non-zero price changes?}
        D -->|Yes| E[View gainers and losers]
        D -->|No| F[Change period or expand data]
    end

    subgraph Card Browsing Flow
        E --> G[Click card name or Explore Cards]
        G --> H[Cards page loads<br>multiple sets visible]
        H --> I[Browse cards from different sets]
        I --> J[Verify Portuguese names<br>with correct accents]
        J --> K[Click a card tile]
    end

    subgraph Card Detail Flow
        K --> L[Card Detail page loads]
        L --> M[Card name displays correctly<br>e.g. Relampago Helice]
        M --> N[View price history chart]
        N --> O[Change period selector]
        O --> N
    end

    subgraph Market Movers Flow
        E --> P[Click Market Movers nav]
        P --> Q[Movers page loads<br>30d default]
        Q --> R[View gainers table<br>cards from multiple sets]
        Q --> S[View losers table<br>real price movements]
        R --> T[Click card name]
        S --> T
        T --> L
    end
